{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day you receive a strange message from a close friend. Included in the message was a video link. What could be on it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of an urban explorer content creator upon their discovery of an abandoned underground facility. Upon entering the facility, they become locked inside. They must find items and progress deeper to eventually find their way out while avoiding the deadly monster that lurks within. Uncover the horrors within and decide whether to leave everything buried, or burn it all away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Stealth mechanics</u></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use vents, distractions, and clever tactics to avoid, lure, and escape the feral entity hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Random item spawns</u></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most items spawn semi-randomly, leading to a unique and replayable experience. Some playthroughs will be easier or more difficult than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Multiple endings</u></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will feature 3 endings. can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decrepit features a full story featuring themes of deception, corporate greed, and self sacrifice. Various audio logs and notes are hidden throughout to help you uncover the truth of what happened in this facility.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997930?t=1762415569","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997930?t=1762415569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997930/16412c8392de1a46e9777b5766ea3d9ab208bce2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762415569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997930/16412c8392de1a46e9777b5766ea3d9ab208bce2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762415569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"dark themes featuring small amounts of gore and blood. a dark story with elements of extortion and mass amounts of death."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day you receive a strange message from a close friend. Included in the message was a video link. What could be on it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of an urban explorer content creator upon their discovery of an abandoned underground facility. Upon entering the facility, they become locked inside. They must find items and progress deeper to eventually find their way out while avoiding the deadly monster that lurks within. Uncover the horrors within and decide whether to leave everything buried, or burn it all away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Stealth mechanics</u></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use vents, distractions, and clever tactics to avoid, lure, and escape the feral entity hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Random item spawns</u></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most items spawn semi-randomly, leading to a unique and replayable experience. Some playthroughs will be easier or more difficult than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Multiple endings</u></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will feature 3 endings. can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decrepit features a full story featuring themes of deception, corporate greed, and self sacrifice. Various audio logs and notes are hidden throughout to help you uncover the truth of what happened in this facility.</p>","developers":["BladeworkzGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997930/6dfccccdfb3cd63507b1dd36ca11489a24e54de6/header.jpg?t=1762415569","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997930/1435395187/3873b4d0d8980a177676d2c44739c34a63ea869b/1761932446/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762415567","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997930/1435395187/3873b4d0d8980a177676d2c44739c34a63ea869b/1761932446/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762415567","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997930/1435395187/3873b4d0d8980a177676d2c44739c34a63ea869b/1761932446/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762415567","id":257225256,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225256/movie480.mp4?t=1762415567","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225256/movie_max.mp4?t=1762415567"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite